<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Seminole Tribe of Florida</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1957</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Seminole Tribe of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/florida">Florida</a> is a federally recognised Native American nation formed in 1957 by descendants of the Seminoles who stayed in Florida after the Seminole Wars. It holds several reservations, including Big Cypress, Brighton and Hollywood. Its gaming enterprises made it wealthy, and in 2007 it bought the Hard Rock Cafe business.</p></div>
